github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-171/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared installer learns npm-packaged CLIs[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]npm-installs[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]npm-installs: add a pure install-route classifier, npm-package install [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]planning with npm/PATH/writability checks, plan-time PATH status, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-entry progress hook in sase.agent_clis; update `sase agent-cli [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]install` rendering, JSON, help, hints, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Install flow in the Updates tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui-install[dim] · [dim][/dim]after npm-installs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui-install: give missing agent-CLI rows an install verb on i / Space / [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]I, a redesigned install detail panel, a digest-bearing confirm preview, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a tracked sequential install proc, one combined flow for mixed plugin + [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CLI marks, install-aware history, result lines, and toasts, plus tests, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs, and goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Discoverability and bulk-select accelerators[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]discover-bulk[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tui-install[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]discover-bulk: add the Available scope, the `*` mark-all-like-this key, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a cross-scope hint when a filter matches nothing, the final detail [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]call-to-action, docs, and goldens.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sa